@cc [owner:spolu,notify:spolu,label:api;error-handling] storage-status-conversion
API error conversions MUST preserve each resource's status mapping, including when combining
resource errors in one transaction. FDB transaction_too_large MUST return CAPACITY after the retry
runner returns. Other database and stored-data decoding failures MUST return INTERNAL. These
statuses MUST carry protocol ErrorDetails and a generic public message. Database, decoding, and
transaction error details MUST NOT be included in the response.
Each resource's ErrorCode mapping MUST be shared by its Status and ErrorDetails conversions.
